# Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct-diffusion-mdlm-v0.1

Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct-diffusion-mdlm-v0.1 is a diffusion-based language model adapted from [Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct) using [MDLM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07524) (masked diffusion), trained with the [dLLM](https://github.com/ZHZisZZ/dllm) framework.


## Model Overview

Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct-diffusion-mdlm-v0.1 has the following features:

<!-- - **Architecture**: Transformer encoder with 8192-token context -->
- **Method**: [Masked Diffusion Language Modeling (MDLM)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07524)
- **Framework**: [dLLM](https://github.com/ZHZisZZ/dllm)
- **Base Model**: [Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct)
- **Datasets**: [opc-sft-stage1](https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenCoder-LLM/opc-sft-stage1) and [opc-sft-stage2](https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenCoder-LLM/opc-sft-stage2) 

For training details, see the [W&B report](https://wandb.ai/asap-zzhou/dllm/reports/dLLM-Tiny-A2D--VmlldzoxNTI2NTEzOA).

